{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Zombietown! </h2><br>Each zombie has a unique ability. Some zombies are fast, some are slow, and others even explode! Your job is to escape town while taking out the zombies. Watch out for the zombies that shoot lasers, and stay on your feet for the zombies that throw eggs. You never know who could be around the next corner!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836810/extras/04b2b7447cd7583862cac42757e5d1e1.avif?t=1716198393\" width=512 height=256 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But Don't Worry, You Have The Right Tools For The Job</h2><br>You can find different equipment around the map. Guns eliminate zombies quickly, but you can run out of ammo if you're not careful. Pills give you temporary powerups, so make them count. Health packs heal you when you get hit by the zombies, and grenades blow up zombies in different ways. The impact blows them up instantly, the incendiary lights the zombies on fire, and the decoy distracts them - the perfect getaway!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836810/extras/99dccae259d73b2fe478c9d512ae274e.avif?t=1716198393\" width=512 height=256 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2836810?t=1716198393","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1716198393","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836810/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1716198393","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836810/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1716198393","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Zombietown! </h2><br>Each zombie has a unique ability. Some zombies are fast, some are slow, and others even explode! Your job is to escape town while taking out the zombies. Watch out for the zombies that shoot lasers, and stay on your feet for the zombies that throw eggs. You never know who could be around the next corner!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836810/extras/04b2b7447cd7583862cac42757e5d1e1.avif?t=1716198393\" width=512 height=256 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But Don't Worry, You Have The Right Tools For The Job</h2><br>You can find different equipment around the map. Guns eliminate zombies quickly, but you can run out of ammo if you're not careful. Pills give you temporary powerups, so make them count. Health packs heal you when you get hit by the zombies, and grenades blow up zombies in different ways. The impact blows them up instantly, the incendiary lights the zombies on fire, and the decoy distracts them - the perfect getaway!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836810/extras/99dccae259d73b2fe478c9d512ae274e.avif?t=1716198393\" width=512 height=256 /></span>","developers":["Richard R."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836810/header.jpg?t=1716198393","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2836810/661423/c01488fe35c078d6eed5f4b87bbeeaa3852b72d5/1750946182/dash_av1.mpd?t=171310